<title>FINLAND: Aamulehti shares suspended -bourse.</title>
<headline>Aamulehti shares suspended -bourse.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in shares of Finnish media group Aamulehti Oy was suspended on Tuesday at the company's own request, the Helsinki stock exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>An Aamulehti spokesman said a statement would be released shortly.  </p>
<p>On Monday, Aamulehti's series II shares closed at 154.50 markka. Its year-low price is 138.60 markka and the year-high 183.00 markka. There had been no trade in the share before the suspension.</p>
<p>No other information was immediately available. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
